{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 主流框架MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"AutoGPT的自主执行机制\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"主流框架\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/主流框架\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"AutoGPT的自主执行机制\" dir=\"auto\">AutoGPT的自主执行机制</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细说明AutoGPT的核心机制，包括它如何实现完全自主运行、自我反思和持续执行，以及它与普通Agent的主要区别。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>AutoGPT的核心定位</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">AutoGPT是2023年发布的第一个实现<strong>完全自主运行</strong>的Agent系统，引发了Agent技术热潮。与普通Agent不同，它不需要人类一步步指令，只需给定一个最终目标，就能自动规划、执行、调整计划，直到完成目标。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心机制：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>目标管理器（Goal Manager）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">接收用户设定的高级目标</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">将目标分解为子任务列表</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">持续追踪目标完成进度</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">优先级动态调整</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>计划生成器（Plan Generator）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">根据目标自动生成执行计划</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">动态调整计划以应对变化</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">处理任务间的依赖关系</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>执行引擎（Execution Engine）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">执行具体任务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">调用工具获取结果</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">将结果反馈给推理模块</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>反思模块（Reflection Module）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">评估执行效果</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">识别问题和不足</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">提出改进建议并调整策略</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>AutoGPT的执行循环：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">设定目标 → 生成计划 → 执行任务 → 评估结果 → 反思修正 → 继续执行 → 完成目标\n    ↑___________________________________________________________↓\n                          （反馈循环）\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>与普通Agent的区别：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>普通Agent</th>\n<th>AutoGPT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>交互方式</td>\n<td>人类逐步指导</td>\n<td>给定目标后完全自主</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行模式</td>\n<td>单次或有限循环</td>\n<td>无限循环直到目标完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反思能力</td>\n<td>无或弱</td>\n<td>内置自我反思模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计划调整</td>\n<td>静态计划</td>\n<td>动态调整计划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源消耗</td>\n<td>可控</td>\n<td>可能非常高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可靠性</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>容易陷入循环或偏离目标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：AutoGPT风格的自主Agent简化实现</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_openai <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> ChatOpenAI\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_core<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> tool\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> json\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">AutoGPTStyleAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_iterations<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>t<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_iterations <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> max_iterations\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>objectives <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completed_tasks <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>failed_tasks <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> objective<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"主执行循环\"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>objectives <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_decompose_objective<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>objective<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        iteration <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>\n\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">while</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>objectives <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> iteration <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_iterations<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            iteration <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\\n=== 迭代 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>iteration<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> ===\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 选择当前任务</span>\n            current_task <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>objectives<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>pop<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"当前任务: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>current_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 生成执行计划</span>\n            plan <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_generate_plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>current_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 执行计划</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_execute_plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completed_tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"task\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> current_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"result\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> result\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"任务完成: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>failed_tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"task\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> current_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"任务失败: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 反思与调整</span>\n            reflection <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_reflect<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"new_tasks\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>objectives<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>extend<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"new_tasks\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"新增任务: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'new_tasks'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_generate_final_report<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_decompose_objective</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> objective<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"目标分解\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"将以下目标分解为具体子任务列表（JSON数组格式）: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>objective<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n        response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>objective<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_generate_plan</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"生成执行计划\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"为以下任务生成执行步骤: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n可用工具: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>keys<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n        response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_execute_plan</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"执行计划\"\"\"</span>\n        results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            tool_name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> step<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            tool_input <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> step<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"input\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> tool_name <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                results<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_reflect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"自我反思\"\"\"</span>\n        context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"completed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completed_tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"failed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>failed_tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"remaining\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>objectives\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"基于以下执行上下文进行反思，是否需要调整策略或添加新任务？</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n        response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_generate_final_report</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"生成最终报告\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"已完成任务: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completed_tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">, 失败任务: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>failed_tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 使用示例</span>\nagent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AutoGPTStyleAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>llm<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>ChatOpenAI<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>search_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> calc_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nresult <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"研究2024年AI Agent领域的重要进展并撰写总结报告\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：AutoGPT为什么会陷入无限循环？如何解决？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：原因包括：目标定义不清、反思机制不足、缺乏外部反馈。解决方法：设置<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">max_iterations</code>限制、引入人工检查点、改进目标分解质量、添加任务完成判定条件。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：AutoGPT在实际生产中的局限性有哪些？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：资源消耗不可控（可能产生大量LLM调用）、可靠性不足（容易偏离目标）、错误累积（一步错步步错）、缺乏人类监督。目前更适合探索性任务而非关键业务流程。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：AutoGPT可以替代所有人工工作。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：AutoGPT适合目标明确、反馈清晰、容错性高的探索性任务。对于需要精确控制、安全合规、实时性要求高的场景，仍需要人类监督和框架级控制。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}